iends stealing their  peanut sacks and thus a Chase ensues  thankfully the boys managed to outsmart  them and reach the market while selling  the peanuts Jose and his group  approached dico and start making fun of  his team once again this time however  Deco has had it so he punches Jose in  Anger one thing leads to another and the  two sets of groups get into a massive  brawl later at home dico's mother is  worried to see her son all bruised up  she asks him what happened and dico  simply lies that it was his teacher who  did the beating uh-oh this infuriates  his mother so she promises to talk to  the teacher the next day however dico's  father interrupts and says that he will  be deal with the teacher and insists  that she focus on her work the next day  he takes dico to work on the way he  reveals that he knows about the fight  and the tournament but instead of  getting angry dico's father suggests he  put aside his feelings and focus on his  skills to win the final game he advises  his young wannabe football player's son  that if he wants to play professionally  he can't be ashamed of who he is knowing  his father is by his side dico becomes  happy and determined to play his best in  the tournament the big day finally  arrives and everybody is cheering up for  Jose and his team of Rich boys once  again the Arrogant boy makes fun of dico  and continues calling him Pele meanwhile  dico and his team finally wear the  secondhand shoes they bought by selling  the stolen peanuts however the boots are  too big for the young boys once the  match starts dico and his friends are  slowed by their oversized boots Jose's  team takes this as an opportunity so  they score goal upon goal making the  score 6-nothing the most goals scored in  one game in the history of all soccer as  the match progresses dico gets angry  when the opponents begin to play foul  and Jose continues to tease him but just  when he is about to attack Jose in a fit  of rage he sees his father in the  au